# Documentation coverage waivers
#
# Format (one per line):
#     <path-or-glob> :: <reason why no doc update is needed>
#
# Use this ONLY when a change genuinely does not alter documented behaviour
# (refactor, typo, test-only, generated file, pure internal rename).
# If the change adds or alters a public surface, update the code-truth docs
# instead of adding a waiver here.
#
# Examples:
#   backend/app/services/__init__.py :: package init only, no public surface
#   frontend/src/components/README.md :: documentation of components, not a component
#
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
